{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"cycling-power-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"cycling-power-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["cycling-power-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Steady-speed pagtatantya, hindi ng isang kapangyarihan-meter pagbabasa o pagsasanay ng reseta. Ito ay nagpapalagay ng isang tuwid na kalsada at pare-pareho ang mga kondisyon. Aero posture, tyres, ibabaw ng kalsada, drafting, acceleration, elevation pagbabago at panahon ay maaaring baguhin ang tunay na kapangyarihan. Negative downhill demand ay ipinapakita bilang zero dahil ang modelong ito ay hindi pagtatantya braking o regenerative kapangyarihan.","record_id":"85d57afd17fdfa378ccbd9196938c29d631b0eef9852cf020c55af6a1df7b4a7","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.5543455806250108,"source":"Steady-speed estimate, not a power-meter reading or training prescription. It assumes a straight road and constant conditions. Aero posture, tires, road surface, drafting, acceleration, elevation changes and weather can change real power. Negative downhill demand is shown as zero because this model does not estimate braking or regenerative power.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"46eea6831c9daf692601a451c3aeb295cae916381bd504532f87c171fadd6b66","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Steady-speed pagtatantya, hindi ng isang kapangyarihan-meter pagbabasa o pagsasanay ng reseta. Ito ay nagpapalagay ng isang tuwid na kalsada at pare-pareho ang mga kondisyon. Aero posture, tyres, ibabaw ng kalsada, drafting, acceleration, elevation pagbabago at panahon ay maaaring baguhin ang tunay na kapangyarihan. Negative downhill demand ay ipinapakita bilang zero dahil ang modelong ito ay hindi pagtatantya braking o regenerative kapangyarihan.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
