{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"roman-numeral-converter UI copy.method.paragraphs.0","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"roman-numeral-converter.copy.method.paragraphs.0","keys":["roman-numeral-converter.copy.method.paragraphs.0"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ang mga karaniwang modernong simbolo ay I, V, X, L, C, D at M. Ang kanilang mga halaga ay ZXQPH0000QXZ, ZXQPH0001QXZ, ZXQPH0002QXZ, ZXQPH0003QXZ, ZXQPH0004QXZ, ZXQPH0005QXZ at ZXQPH0006QXZ.","record_id":"85df6bcd2e0d0ae4b1237e61a5a3ca9ad913c1cca81cf24be8ba818a9a81c166","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.584337896624959,"source":"The common modern symbols are I, V, X, L, C, D and M. Their values are 1, 5, 10, 50, 100, 500 and 1,000. Ordinary output uses modern subtractive notation within each place value.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"b0d430833c97d4615210216e99aefb6e68d00809a95b83e19ff5456f0af12382","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ang mga karaniwang modernong simbolo ay I, V, X, L, C, D at M. Ang kanilang mga halaga ay 1, 5, 10, 50, 100, 500 at 1,000.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
